{"parse": {"title": "金钟灵质瓶", "pageid": 54982, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"金钟灵质瓶\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/54/Item-110804.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"金钟灵质瓶\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>金钟灵质瓶</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#110804</div></div><hr /><div>以灵为质，以体为植。用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式，亦可作为合成高阶材料的素材。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">传闻为封存诡秘活灵的棺椁。每一支都奉若至宝，千金不换；其主对来历支支吾吾，讳莫如深。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">来源</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-stage\"></td><td class=\"source-text\">荒原合成</td></tr><tr><td class=\"source-stage\"></td><td class=\"source-text\">迷途鉴定</td></tr></tbody></table><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">配方</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/110803\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%87%91%E8%8D%89%E7%84%9A%E9%A6%99\" title=\"金草焚香\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%87%91%E8%8D%89%E7%84%9A%E9%A6%99\" title=\"金草焚香\"><img alt=\"金草焚香\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/Item-110803.png/100px-Item-110803.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/Item-110803.png/150px-Item-110803.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/Item-110803.png/200px-Item-110803.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%87%91%E8%8D%89%E7%84%9A%E9%A6%99\" title=\"金草焚香\">金草焚香</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">材质难辨的秘制焚香，多用以调养心症。用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式，亦可作为合成高阶材料的素材。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×3</span></span></td><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/111002\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%87%91%E7%88%AA%E7%81%B5%E6%91%86\" title=\"金爪灵摆\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%87%91%E7%88%AA%E7%81%B5%E6%91%86\" title=\"金爪灵摆\"><img alt=\"金爪灵摆\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Item-111002.png/100px-Item-1110